WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.220
OSINT must be reviewable.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:05.480
Record the requirement, date, analyst, search concepts, source categories,

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.710
and significant steps.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:10.790
Documentation should let another qualified person understand how the work moved from

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:14.520
question to finding without exposing unnecessary sensitive details.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:18.560
Preserve URLs, access timestamps, page titles, authorship where available,

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.010
and relevant excerpts.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.634
Public pages can change or disappear.

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:25.410
Approved screenshots or archives can preserve what was visible at a particular time,

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:29.600
but they should include enough context to avoid turning a cropped image into a misleading

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.140
artifact.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:32.817
Follow organizational rules for evidence preservation.

00:00:32.817 --> 00:00:34.700
Record file names, collection times,

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.120
and any transformations such as translation or format conversion.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:41.340
Keep original material separate from working copies when integrity matters,

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:44.380
and restrict access according to sensitivity and legal requirements.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.500
A chain of reasoning connects observations to judgments.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.110
Label direct observations, source claims, assumptions,

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.980
and analytical inferences separately.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:55.080
For example, a filing may confirm an address on a date;

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.664
it does not automatically prove current occupancy or control.

00:00:58.664 --> 00:01:01.640
Repeatability does not mean every public result will remain identical.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.380
Search rankings and websites change.

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:05.940
It means the method, source trail, preserved evidence,

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:10.251
and decision logic are documented well enough for review and reasonable reproduction.

00:01:10.251 --> 00:01:12.775
Auditability protects both the audience and the analyst.

00:01:12.775 --> 00:01:17.535
It supports quality assurance, correction, legal review, and responsible handoff.

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:19.695
Documentation should be sufficient for the purpose but proportionate:

00:01:19.695 --> 00:01:23.760
do not retain unrelated personal data simply to make a case file look comprehensive.
